	(text "External analog inputs: 1k series, 100k to 0.75 V (TW-E04, TW-E30)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb6b02b5-3d1f-5c1f-8f85-587afd0d578e")
	)
	(text "Inputs within 0 to 1.5 V, never driven while the chip is unpowered: the clamps go to IOVDD (TW-E30).\nThe firmware selects them with FREQ_STATUS[6:5] = 11, the reset value (TW-E04)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fcd8bd9b-14b4-5676-966e-103cbd68f1c3")
	)
	(text "RF debug output: the four RF pads joined (TW-E03), 1 kOhm load into a 50 Ohm analyzer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "399e8ef6-4e69-5d8a-8eb3-3cd05b4bb4c5")
	)
	(text "The outputs sit at about 0.75 V: keep C602 (TW-E30). R615 + 50 Ohm loads the joined pads with 1 kOhm,\nthe analyzer reads 26.0 dB below the voltage at RF_SUM. Remove R611 to R614 but one to measure a single output.\nNo filter on this board: the 25 % switching mixer puts power at 3 f and 5 f. Measure into the analyzer only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0142e6f7-8cd9-5e59-803d-5a8b4389923e")
	)
